  "markdown": "top of page\n\nSkip to Main Content\n\n## OUR STORY\n\nREACH Meetings & Events subscribes to the notion that when you bring people together you can change the world.\n\n​\n\nWe formed REACH Meetings & Events because we saw the opportunity to offer a unique level of service through our consultative, collaborative, and creative approaches.\n\n​\n\nOur goal is always to manage unforgettable events so that our clients have the opportunity to fully harness the richness of the event's outcome.\n\n​\n\n## OUR TEAM\n\n[![Lauren%2520headshot_edited_edited.png](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_1d65cea9ad234dd18a20499202af19bc~mv2.png/v1/crop/x_123,y_40,w_434,h_433/fill/w_181,h_182,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Lauren%252520headshot_edited_edited.png)](https://www.reachmeetings.com/meet-lauren-dunnaway)\n\n###### Lauren Dunnaway\n\n###### Co-Founder, President\n\n[![GretchenEDIT-43_edited.png](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_a9d81dc4b38d4b84a52bbf8976574505~mv2.png/v1/crop/x_388,y_283,w_1261,h_1267/fill/w_181,h_182,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/GretchenEDIT-43_edited.png)](https://www.reachmeetings.com/gretchen-mitchell-bio)\n\n###### Gretchen Mitchell  Co-Founder, CEO\n\n[![DeeDee Bailey_edited_edited.jpg](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_d57bc879223a43a7b06b7d34da728ca2~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_0,y_135,w_2034,h_1765/fill/w_188,h_178,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/DeeDee%20Bailey_edited_edited.jpg)](https://www.reachmeetings.com/gretchen-mitchell-bio)\n\n###### DeeDee Bailey  Senior Planner\n\n[![Nora Bakke Headshot_edited.jpg](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_e30cf14f342a4a208f82a504eb0adff4~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_0,y_376,w_1446,h_1623/fill/w_165,h_178,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Nora%20Bakke%20Headshot_edited.jpg)](https://www.reachmeetings.com/gretchen-mitchell-bio)\n\n###### Nora Bakke  Senior Planner\n\n[![Traci Colangelo.jpg](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_888c30f569a84779a318e562dd11d9ba~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_0,y_127,w_2309,h_2318/fill/w_181,h_182,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Traci%20Colangelo.jpg)](https://www.reachmeetings.com/gretchen-mitchell-bio)\n\n###### Traci Colangelo  Senior Sourcing Specialist & Travel Manager\n\n[![Taylor Headshot (002)_edited_edited.png](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/570280_687c7152dafe4b1392ab11ab46d94b5a~mv2.png/v1/crop/x_191,y_168,w_844,h_870/fill/w_180,h_187,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Taylor%20Headshot%20(002)_edited_edited.png)](https://www.reachmeetings.com/gretchen-mitchell-bio)\n\n###### Taylor Brown  Meeting Planner\n\n[![olga portrait 5_edited.png](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_0b50a98242ad4e6f8f69688b271c3861~mv2.png/v1/crop/x_0,y_252,w_991,h_1102/fill/w_151,h_164,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/olga%20portrait%205_edited.png)](https://www.reachmeetings.com/gretchen-mitchell-bio)\n\n###### Olga Carroll  Sourcing Manager\n\n[![Krista%20Gibson%20headshot_edited.png](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_1045126932eb469eaacec7d329002ff2~mv2.png/v1/crop/x_439,y_25,w_1476,h_1500/fill/w_208,h_212,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Krista%2520Gibson%2520headshot_edited.png)](https://www.reachmeetings.com/gretchen-mitchell-bio)\n\n###### Krista Gibson\n\nSourcing Manager\n\n[![Ginger_edited.png](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_1ffa9c691d3a42e995fa0270c477c1f4~mv2.png/v1/crop/x_3,y_0,w_172,h_200/fill/w_151,h_175,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Ginger_edited.png)](https://www.reachmeetings.com/gretchen-mitchell-bio)\n\n###### Ginger Murchison\n\nSenior Planner\n\n[![Ashley%20Hellstern_edited.png](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_5d2aac56224c42d8a365a3b2caf294d5~mv2.png/v1/crop/x_0,y_0,w_300,h_305/fill/w_166,h_175,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Ashley%2520Hellstern_edited.png)](https://www.reachmeetings.com/gretchen-mitchell-bio)\n\n###### Ashley Hellstern\n\nTravel Agent & Disney Specialist\n\n[![Nathalie headshot_edited.png](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/570280_e5031b137375452496a1ae41656ef3e5~mv2.png/v1/crop/x_0,y_0,w_1944,h_1882/fill/w_161,h_175,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Nathalie%20headshot_edited.png)](https://www.reachmeetings.com/gretchen-mitchell-bio)\n\n###### Nathalie Proche'\n\nTravel Advisor\n\n## OUR CLIENTS\n\nFor over 20 years, we have served corporate clientele around the world. Today, our customer base is comprised mainly of Executive teams, Association leaders, Boards of Directors from various sectors as well as Sales organizations. In our leisure business, we serve discerning clientele requiring white glove or group travel services.\n\n​\n\n[![REACH logo](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_b6659293240c40db888d813137f151bc~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_240,h_100,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Reach%20Logo%20jpg.jpg)](https://www.reachmeetings.com/)\n\nbottom of page",
